stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NoKey
  NoKey --> Active: Web Crypto generates non-extractable P-256 key
  Active --> Registered: Public JWK registered with API
  Registered --> Signed: Sign a context-bound commitment
  Signed --> Registered: Next round
  Registered --> Rotated: Generate replacement and revoke old key
  Registered --> Revoked: Revoke after compromise or device loss
  Rotated --> Registered: New key active
  Revoked --> NoKey: Generate on next device
  Rotated --> Historical: Old public key retained for verification
  Revoked --> Historical: Old public key retained for verification
